WEBVTT

00:00:02.290 --> 00:00:03.730
To be honest,

00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:08.630
we're having a hard time dealing 
with you, Viscount Remedius.

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:10.610
What are you talking about, Zemunn?

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:15.670
This bastard's company, Rahzel Company, 
is selling Jushiki weapons to Dochetta.

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:19.840
Urmun is suffering because 
of the weapons he invented.

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:22.620
We ought to kill him in the name of Zhuo Lu!

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:23.790
Yeah!

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:24.870
Kill him!

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:26.250
Fools!

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:28.970
You've abducted him
without thinking it through.

00:00:28.970 --> 00:00:31.510
Do you want the Dragon Empire against us, too?

00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:34.380
But we can't let him go!

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:35.600
Yeah.

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:37.520
Stop it, Navarro.

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:38.990
You too, Najik.

00:00:38.990 --> 00:00:40.390
Stay out of this, Naricia.

00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:42.310
We need to avenge our people.

00:00:42.950 --> 00:00:49.270
Um, with all due respect, that Majouken 
will explode if you fire it.

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:51.380
Shut your mouth!

00:01:01.570 --> 00:01:04.620
Dust had gotten into the contact terminal.

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:08.880
You need to replace them once every three 
months in a desert area like Urmun.

00:01:12.180 --> 00:01:13.560
Check mine, too!

00:01:13.560 --> 00:01:14.720
Mine, too, please!

00:01:16.550 --> 00:01:18.970
Hang on. One at a time.

00:01:21.220 --> 00:01:24.550
See? Remedius is awesome, isn't he?

00:01:25.480 --> 00:01:26.890
Seriously?

00:01:26.890 --> 00:01:28.150
Wow.

00:01:37.490 --> 00:01:41.490
<b>Invitation to an Evening Party</b>

00:01:38.900 --> 00:01:40.010
Yeah.

00:01:40.010 --> 00:01:41.490
It's already taken care of.

00:01:42.550 --> 00:01:44.540
It's just one after another.

00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:45.750
Damn Magatsushiki...

00:01:46.340 --> 00:01:48.810
When are they going to stop?

00:01:52.010 --> 00:01:54.000
Apparently Largonkin's people

00:01:54.520 --> 00:01:57.630
made quick work of the Magatsushiki 
that showed up in the subway.

00:01:58.260 --> 00:01:59.340
What's wrong?

00:02:00.370 --> 00:02:01.760
Is it about Premelena?

00:02:02.550 --> 00:02:04.730
I don't care about the girl's life.

00:02:05.430 --> 00:02:06.770
You're quite cold.

00:02:07.130 --> 00:02:11.900
I gave that woman death as a Draken warrior.

00:02:12.710 --> 00:02:13.750
That's all.

00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:19.070
You're on time.

00:02:19.070 --> 00:02:20.190
Excellent.

00:02:20.190 --> 00:02:21.660
And the person we're negotiating with?

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:24.660
They're already here, it seems.

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:29.200
They're extremely well-prepared.

00:02:29.200 --> 00:02:30.670
Let's be careful.

00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:32.540
I know.

00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:38.380
So these are the faces of the Aurora Hammer,
 the ones who are trying to take down

00:02:38.380 --> 00:02:40.430
Urmun's terrible dictator, Dochetta.

00:02:41.280 --> 00:02:43.000
Stop there.

00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:47.860
Calpulnia herself came, as was agreed.

00:02:48.720 --> 00:02:50.810
Where is Party Leader Zemunn?

00:02:51.320 --> 00:02:53.850
He's no longer the party leader.

00:02:53.850 --> 00:02:56.200
Then who do I negotiate with?

00:02:57.650 --> 00:02:59.200
You'll negotiate with me.

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:02.800
I'm the leader of the Aurora Hammer.

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:07.060
The organization calls me Zhuo Lu, 
the Man-Eating Dragon of the Sand.

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:11.050
Hey, we said we'd be cautious.

00:03:11.050 --> 00:03:12.710
That man is dangerous.

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:15.930
As dangerous as the cardinal's
 Winged Generals.

00:03:15.930 --> 00:03:17.590
Possibly even more so.

00:03:18.160 --> 00:03:19.470
Are you serious?

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:22.350
Where is the ransom money?

00:03:22.350 --> 00:03:24.920
We'll see the hostage first.

00:03:24.920 --> 00:03:27.970
You ought to show your hand first.

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:37.520
Now it's your turn.

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:39.980
Where is my nephew, Remedius?

00:03:56.050 --> 00:03:58.090
Then let's begin the exchange.

00:03:58.530 --> 00:03:59.960
Not yet.

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:03.530
Just based on appearance, I wouldn't be able
to tell if he were a fake who's had plastic surgery.

00:04:04.370 --> 00:04:06.170
Prove it with this.

00:04:08.820 --> 00:04:11.450
A Jushiki wavelength identifier?

00:04:11.450 --> 00:04:12.390
All right.

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:23.540
<i>Confirmed match 
with 99.9988 percent certainty.</i>

00:04:24.240 --> 00:04:25.540
Very well.

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:41.420
Shit!

00:04:48.690 --> 00:04:49.560
Gigina!

00:04:57.020 --> 00:04:58.840
Is it another force that just showed up?

00:04:58.840 --> 00:04:59.720
Hell if I know!

00:04:59.720 --> 00:05:01.140
Just focus on getting out of here!

00:05:13.930 --> 00:05:17.040
I can't believe a human being could 
produce such a powerful Jushiki barrier.

00:05:17.360 --> 00:05:18.500
Impossible.

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:21.800
Die.

00:05:29.440 --> 00:05:33.060
Sixth-order numerical 
quantum Jushiki, Sui Tori.

00:05:33.570 --> 00:05:37.900
It converts the amino acids throughout 
the body with quantum interference.

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:39.500
A demon's Jushiki.

00:05:41.480 --> 00:05:43.850
We could have been dead if I hadn't

00:05:43.850 --> 00:05:47.540
defended us with my Phoenic,
 and you hadn't healed us with your O Se.

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:50.730
The Sand Dragon...

00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:54.580
A ghastly slaughter, as though 
the victims had been chewed up.

00:05:55.880 --> 00:05:57.200
Where's Remedius?

00:05:57.200 --> 00:05:58.460
My nephew?

00:05:59.560 --> 00:06:01.990
Sadly, I believe it's too late.

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:08.970
Either Zhuo Lu or the attackers 
left us with an unwanted gift.

00:06:27.640 --> 00:06:29.800
Drink up, man.

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:31.000
Thanks.

00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:34.150
But I'm still a hostage, am I not?

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:38.040
I'd like to thank you.

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:40.170
You saved our lives.

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:42.170
With our Jushiki weapons, too.

00:06:42.170 --> 00:06:44.350
Mine's in great shape!

00:06:44.350 --> 00:06:45.300
Mine, too!

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:46.830
Thanks.

00:06:46.830 --> 00:06:47.930
It's nothing.

00:06:47.930 --> 00:06:50.480
I just lent a small hand.

00:06:50.480 --> 00:06:53.550
We repay those who save
our lives with our own.

00:06:54.440 --> 00:06:57.930
Use my life, too, when you need it

00:06:58.270 --> 00:07:00.190
Mine, too.

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:01.860
In the name of Zhuo Lu!

00:07:03.640 --> 00:07:06.600
Najik, Navarro...

00:07:09.460 --> 00:07:14.950
A long time ago, Urmun was under 
the control of a bad king.

00:07:15.230 --> 00:07:18.950
The people suffered, and cries 
of discontent echoed across the land.

00:07:19.400 --> 00:07:22.710
The people prayed to God, 
but there was no answer.

00:07:23.860 --> 00:07:27.460
One woman's husband and children 
were killed by the king.

00:07:28.230 --> 00:07:32.350
Out of despair, she climbed the 
northern Urmun mountain of Derilla,

00:07:32.350 --> 00:07:35.980
known as the Mountains of Hell, in an 
effort to take her own life as well.

00:07:36.970 --> 00:07:39.870
The woman walked for seven days and nights

00:07:39.870 --> 00:07:42.310
through the mountain of death, 
not a blade of grass in sight.

00:07:42.990 --> 00:07:44.570
Yet she couldn't die.

00:07:44.570 --> 00:07:48.480
Her wailing echoed through 
the mountains and valleys.

00:07:49.030 --> 00:07:54.520
When the woman came to, 
she saw the Sand Dragon, Zhuo Lu.

00:07:54.920 --> 00:07:57.490
The woman begged Zhuo Lu for help.

00:07:58.180 --> 00:08:02.880
But the dragon had been sealed in the 
mountain for the crime of eating people.

00:08:02.880 --> 00:08:05.500
It had lost its former powers.

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:09.610
The woman said, "Then eat me."

00:08:09.610 --> 00:08:14.510
"Let my blood and flesh become your dragon 
strength, and defeat the bad king."

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:18.260
The woman jumped into the dragon's mouth.

00:08:23.480 --> 00:08:27.200
The dragon, having regained its strength,
 escaped the mountains,

00:08:27.200 --> 00:08:30.220
flew through the deserts, 
and descended on the palace,

00:08:30.220 --> 00:08:32.810
where he shredded to death the 
bad king and his henchmen.

00:08:34.060 --> 00:08:38.280
Zhuo Lu said to the people: 
"Give your flesh and blood,

00:08:38.640 --> 00:08:43.560
and I will appear when you need 
to consume the enemies of Urmun."

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:49.020
And with a sad howl, 
Zhuo Lu vanished into the distant sky.

00:08:49.700 --> 00:08:55.060
Now, until it receives blood and flesh again,

00:08:56.070 --> 00:09:00.380
the dragon slumbers somewhere 
in Derilla, the Mountains of Hell.

00:09:03.510 --> 00:09:05.560
That's a sad story.

00:09:05.960 --> 00:09:09.690
The people were never truly 
saved from their suffering.

00:09:09.950 --> 00:09:15.320
This nation is suffering so much that we'd 
prefer to place our faith in a fairy tale.

00:09:15.840 --> 00:09:19.380
That's why I'll be Zhuo Lu.

00:09:19.380 --> 00:09:22.250
I'll become the dragon that'll 
consume the bad king Dochetta.

00:09:25.080 --> 00:09:29.520
His Highness Dochetta has not 
given a fourth-rank citizen

00:09:29.520 --> 00:09:32.080
permission to open a shop here.

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:33.210
But...

00:09:34.150 --> 00:09:35.610
You insect.

00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:40.760
That's...

00:09:41.360 --> 00:09:43.780
What the hell are you doing? Run!

00:09:43.780 --> 00:09:47.020
I was told they would be used 
to maintain peace, and yet...

00:09:47.320 --> 00:09:48.890
A weapon is a weapon!

00:09:53.660 --> 00:09:54.700
Naricia!

00:09:59.440 --> 00:10:00.600
Die.

00:10:15.190 --> 00:10:17.760
Yesterday's exchange was a failure.

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:22.700
The guards are dead, and the enemy 
made off with the two billion yen ransom.

00:10:22.700 --> 00:10:25.220
I lost my nephew, Remedius.

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:29.940
Who am I to hold accountable for all this?

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:34.950
It's true that my partner 
and I had our failings.

00:10:35.570 --> 00:10:39.210
But our mission was to protect you.

00:10:39.990 --> 00:10:42.620
I believe we accomplished that.

00:10:43.590 --> 00:10:46.630
Can you think of who the attackers might 
have been and what their motive was?

00:10:47.540 --> 00:10:48.790
I've got nothing.

00:10:49.240 --> 00:10:52.920
The police investigation at the 
site turned up nothing, too.

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:57.950
And Egurrd has been missing 
ever since the incident.

00:10:57.950 --> 00:11:01.660
Do you believe Egurrd was somehow involved?

00:11:02.320 --> 00:11:03.740
I don't know.

00:11:09.300 --> 00:11:10.560
What's that?

00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:12.650
A chells piece.

00:11:12.650 --> 00:11:20.540
This is the play that won Remedius 
the continental competition.

00:11:20.540 --> 00:11:21.820
Birds and elephants...

00:11:22.090 --> 00:11:23.780
Those are some odd pieces.

00:11:24.230 --> 00:11:25.290
Yes.

00:11:25.290 --> 00:11:28.300
This is apparently how it used to be.

00:11:28.300 --> 00:11:30.640
Nowadays, the elephant is a bishop,

00:11:30.640 --> 00:11:33.500
and the birds and boats are rooks.

00:11:34.180 --> 00:11:38.300
Come to think of it, 
I've been cruel to that boy.

00:11:38.300 --> 00:11:42.280
I made him give up the game that he 
loved for the sake of the company,

00:11:42.280 --> 00:11:43.970
and forced him into research.

00:11:44.300 --> 00:11:46.600
He had such a strong sense of justice.

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:48.510
To think of how much he suffered

00:11:48.510 --> 00:11:53.440
when he learned of how the weapons 
of his invention were being used in Urmun...

00:11:57.160 --> 00:12:01.360
Now, I'd like to make 
one more request of you.

00:12:02.000 --> 00:12:04.540
Track down the Aurora Hammer

00:12:04.540 --> 00:12:08.830
and bring home Remedius, no matter what.

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:13.260
That's the only way you can atone to me.

00:12:15.270 --> 00:12:17.690
I know it's for the sake of security,

00:12:17.690 --> 00:12:22.020
but it's such a pain in the ass that 
they confiscate them before we land.

00:12:24.900 --> 00:12:25.980
Stand still.

00:12:25.980 --> 00:12:26.930
Just listen.

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:30.330
I sense someone watching us.

00:12:30.330 --> 00:12:32.350
In the direction of 3:16.

00:12:32.790 --> 00:12:34.940
Pitch of 6.1 degrees.

00:12:34.940 --> 00:12:37.100
Approximately 550 merters away.

00:12:38.260 --> 00:12:39.150
Where?

00:12:39.630 --> 00:12:40.600
Too late.

00:12:40.600 --> 00:12:41.570
They're already gone.

00:12:42.850 --> 00:12:44.300
Who was it?

00:12:44.300 --> 00:12:46.440
One of my insane stalkers?

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:52.310
Distasteful jokes aside, it smells 
the same as the last incident.

00:12:55.480 --> 00:12:58.000
Mouldeen has nothing to do with this.

00:12:58.360 --> 00:13:02.340
Let's get Vinnel to hunt down 
the Aurora Hammer.

00:13:02.960 --> 00:13:07.020
We might have been better off
 turning down this job.

00:13:07.020 --> 00:13:08.700
It's too late now.

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:10.980
We're already a part of this.

00:13:16.200 --> 00:13:17.480
This is Tarelk.

00:13:17.880 --> 00:13:19.290
Isn't it magnificent?

00:13:20.100 --> 00:13:21.730
Magnificently in my way.

00:13:22.090 --> 00:13:24.740
Also, don't go giving cabinets names.

00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:28.040
This child has excellent 
storage capabilities.

00:13:28.470 --> 00:13:31.700
A person could fit in here.

00:13:32.130 --> 00:13:34.700
Not you, Gigina.

00:13:36.550 --> 00:13:37.930
Nonsense.

00:13:37.930 --> 00:13:39.860
My son can do anything.

00:13:40.470 --> 00:13:42.800
Cabinets store limitless potential.

00:13:43.600 --> 00:13:44.550
Not happening.

00:13:46.470 --> 00:13:48.390
Want to bet a hundred yen?

00:13:50.020 --> 00:13:51.550
How's that?

00:13:51.550 --> 00:13:53.380
I fit snugly inside.

00:13:55.090 --> 00:13:57.600
All right, you win.

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:13.740
Tarelk, that's enough.

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:17.210
Gayus, open up. I'm coming out.

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:22.750
Sir, it'll be a hundred yen to leave.

00:14:22.750 --> 00:14:27.620
How about I make some room 
between your neck and torso?

00:14:29.220 --> 00:14:31.100
Sure, be my guest.

00:14:31.100 --> 00:14:36.020
You're free to break out 
of your beloved cabinet, sir.

00:14:39.220 --> 00:14:40.380
I gave it back.

00:14:40.380 --> 00:14:41.560
Let me out.

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:43.150
Not so fast.

00:14:43.150 --> 00:14:47.530
It's another thousand yen to open the door.

00:14:47.530 --> 00:14:50.910
Further, it'll be another 
ten thousand to motivate me.

00:14:53.920 --> 00:14:56.600
Gayus!

00:14:58.440 --> 00:15:03.040
Gigina, you're way too 
badass for me right now.

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:08.180
You'll pay with your life for the 
tragedy that has befallen Tarelk!

00:15:08.180 --> 00:15:10.170
Die!

00:15:11.400 --> 00:15:13.580
H-Hang on!

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:20.230
Largonkin.

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:22.380
Yeah...

00:15:22.870 --> 00:15:23.990
All right.

00:15:28.530 --> 00:15:30.450
Ah, glad you made it.

00:15:31.270 --> 00:15:33.830
Let me introduce you to our top people.

00:15:34.320 --> 00:15:35.590
Iegie.

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:37.260
Jabeira.

00:15:38.880 --> 00:15:40.630
They're both 12th-rank.

00:15:41.800 --> 00:15:44.140
You know of Vice President Yahkto, don't you?

00:15:46.320 --> 00:15:49.710
Huh, so this is that sword dancer...

00:15:49.710 --> 00:15:54.090
Old Man Largonkin, 
is this guy actually that good?

00:15:57.220 --> 00:16:00.280
I'd expect no less of the Draken warrior race.

00:16:00.280 --> 00:16:01.810
You're perfectly crazy.

00:16:01.810 --> 00:16:06.520
Is that all you've got to say, 
inferior Alurian?

00:16:08.950 --> 00:16:10.340
Stop it.

00:16:13.080 --> 00:16:14.550
Did I surprise you?

00:16:15.360 --> 00:16:19.380
Iryu, 12th-order 
electromagnetic optics Jushiki.

00:16:20.340 --> 00:16:22.060
Sorry about him.

00:16:22.060 --> 00:16:27.420
He's jealous of your title as 
Eridana's top Jushiki swordsman.

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:31.340
By the way, this isn't a 
polite thing to ask, but...

00:16:32.400 --> 00:16:34.840
Gayus, are you in a relationship?

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:37.510
Y-Yeah, I am.

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:42.240
Damn it, you have a collar on you.

00:16:42.240 --> 00:16:44.980
Go get impaled by a stick, you dog!

00:16:45.940 --> 00:16:49.690
Jabeira's personality changes 
depending on her mood.

00:16:49.690 --> 00:16:52.650
You'll meet the others soon.

00:16:54.330 --> 00:16:57.480
First of all, what is a Magatsushiki?

00:16:57.480 --> 00:17:02.910
One theory suggests they're beings 
of information existing in phase.

00:17:03.260 --> 00:17:08.880
It's also said that their 
very existence is a Jushiki.

00:17:08.880 --> 00:17:13.560
Thus they create their own bodies

00:17:13.560 --> 00:17:17.840
by taking in matter of this 
world and rearranging it.

00:17:17.840 --> 00:17:19.130
Too long.

00:17:19.130 --> 00:17:20.810
Give us a summary, Yahkto.

00:17:21.120 --> 00:17:25.850
The point is that a Magatsushiki is a 
different kind of being from ourselves.

00:17:26.420 --> 00:17:29.770
Their minds and motives are 
difficult to comprehend.

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:32.720
Is it just me,

00:17:32.720 --> 00:17:35.360
or are the Magatsushiki emerging 
closer and closer to the city center?

00:17:35.680 --> 00:17:37.320
That's right.

00:17:37.320 --> 00:17:40.080
It looks as though there's 
some kind of rule or intent,

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:41.960
but for the time being, it's unknown.

00:17:41.960 --> 00:17:44.340
We're still investing this 
and similar incidents.

00:17:45.200 --> 00:17:47.600
Sir, you mustn't.

00:17:47.600 --> 00:17:49.110
What's going on?

00:17:49.110 --> 00:17:52.950
A-Are you Mr. Largonkin?

00:17:54.180 --> 00:17:57.260
I'm Deacon Sarvey.

00:17:57.720 --> 00:17:59.840
Th-This is for you.

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:11.980
This is our gift to you.

00:18:11.980 --> 00:18:15.800
And now for the happy play.

00:18:16.240 --> 00:18:20.240
The second act shall be a tragedy.

00:18:32.130 --> 00:18:34.070
Deacon Sarvey!

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:40.590
What impiety towards me, the father of death!

00:18:43.560 --> 00:18:46.890
He's eating his Jushiki power.

00:18:48.120 --> 00:18:50.770
And he got a promotion from 
deacon to father, too.

00:18:51.400 --> 00:18:54.020
All units, fire Fel Fu!

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:01.200
That model itself was a Magatsushiki.

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:04.420
The father is an attacker, 
and the box protected him.

00:19:05.070 --> 00:19:08.410
It seems the Magatsushiki are learning 
the art of warfare as well.

00:19:11.300 --> 00:19:14.340
Iegie, Jabeira, let's take it down.

00:19:14.650 --> 00:19:15.550
All right.

00:19:25.990 --> 00:19:27.850
What irreverence!

00:19:30.160 --> 00:19:31.240
You aren't getting away!

00:19:31.240 --> 00:19:32.960
Take this!

00:19:36.040 --> 00:19:39.110
Gaft poison is pretty powerful.

00:19:50.460 --> 00:19:53.120
All right, your girl Jabeira's 
going to finish you off.

00:20:03.820 --> 00:20:05.420
It's over.

00:20:08.800 --> 00:20:11.770
Well, well, what a spectacle.

00:20:12.890 --> 00:20:17.230
Don't get too serious, would you?

00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:20.540
I'm just here to say hi for today.

00:20:21.330 --> 00:20:22.780
Or...

00:20:22.780 --> 00:20:26.280
Have you not spilled enough blood?

00:20:30.290 --> 00:20:31.460
Pops...

00:20:31.860 --> 00:20:32.980
Stop.

00:20:34.900 --> 00:20:38.560
You aren't ordinary Magatsushiki, are you?

00:20:38.560 --> 00:20:41.230
Correct!

00:20:41.230 --> 00:20:44.080
I am the grave crawler,

00:20:44.080 --> 00:20:50.310
type 498, Viscount Amupura.

00:20:50.800 --> 00:20:56.460
I'm the weaver of war, 
type 502, Baron Janahn Ghalan.

00:20:57.200 --> 00:20:59.100
You're numbered...

00:20:59.100 --> 00:21:02.320
You're the rulers of the Magatsushiki, 
the Great Magatsushiki?

00:21:02.320 --> 00:21:04.540
Indeed.

00:21:04.540 --> 00:21:09.500
You lot were chosen to be on the 
board of the evening party.

00:21:09.500 --> 00:21:11.620
You should be honored.

00:21:12.920 --> 00:21:13.960
Wait, Amupura.

00:21:14.440 --> 00:21:16.330
See that man's right hand?

00:21:18.460 --> 00:21:20.830
Oh, dear!

00:21:20.830 --> 00:21:24.840
An Eye of the Cosmos, taken from the Vaisen.

00:21:26.600 --> 00:21:32.220
Why does an insignificant
being like yourself have that?

00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:35.370
I like it!

00:21:35.370 --> 00:21:38.980
I like it, Baron Janahn Ghalan.

00:21:39.590 --> 00:21:45.580
How about we change one of the 
rules of the evening party?

00:21:45.580 --> 00:21:49.990
Yeah. As a forced condition of 
victory in the evening party,

00:21:49.990 --> 00:21:52.490
let's bet their heads, and <i>that</i>.

00:21:53.120 --> 00:21:55.770
The curtain fall draws near.

00:21:56.150 --> 00:21:58.810
The final act is at high noon, 
three days from now.

00:21:59.250 --> 00:22:03.460
Should that time pass, 
the board will be destroyed.

00:22:06.210 --> 00:22:08.520
The curtain fall in three days?

00:22:08.520 --> 00:22:12.260
What the hell are those 
Great Magatsushiki plotting?

00:23:50.820 --> 00:23:56.580
The most terrifying thing in the 
world is an inability to communicate.

00:23:57.580 --> 00:24:00.460
It is a world of endless desert,

00:24:00.460 --> 00:24:03.350
where words and meaning are lost.

00:24:02.460 --> 00:24:04.960
<b>Calm Days and Lonely Nights</b>
